mandatoryActions.instructionsAndNotes:
[S] Webjob throws time out error when the log text is too long
[For upgrade person]
Add this section to the Web Job appsettings.json (root level)
"Logging": {
"LogLevel": {
"Default": "Information",
"Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Database.Command": "Warning",
"Azure.Core": "Error"
}
},
